      {
        "id": "TaliyahQ",
        "name": "Threaded Volley",
        "description": "Taliyah throws a volley of rocks in a target direction, moving freely as she casts. This creates Worked Ground below her. If Taliyah casts Threaded Volley on Worked Ground, she consumes the ground to throw a stronger boulder that slows enemies.",
        "tooltip": "Taliyah hurls 5 rocks, each dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(55/72.5/90/107.5/125 + (50% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> in an area around the first enemy hit while creating Worked Ground at that area. Subsequent hits against the same enemy deal 60% less damage.<br /><br />Casts on worked ground cost 10 Mana and have 50% less Cooldown, consume the Worked Ground, and hurl a boulder that <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slows</span> enemies it hits by 20/25/30/35/40% for 1.5 seconds, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(99/130.5/162/193.5/225 + (90% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> to the primary target. Monsters hit by the boulder are <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Stunned</span> for 3 seconds.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Taliyah can move and use other Abilities while hurling rocks.<br />Casting this Ability on Worked Ground cannot reduce its Cooldown to less than 0.75 seconds.<br />Total damage to a single target: <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(143/188.5/234/279.5/325 + (130% Ability Power))</span><br />Each rock deals <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">20/25/30/35/40</span> additional damage to monsters.</span>",
